<title>USA: Glencoe ISD 2859, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Glencoe ISD 2859, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc said it won $2.255 million of Glencoe-Silver Lake Independent School District No. 2859, Minn., general obligation capital facilities bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.62 percent.</p>
</text>
